S1 of the rank-zero representation (619eedb6c). The run can now hold a value of rank zero:
`Array::createRankZero`, `size` taken from `numel` when there is no extent, and `__index_arr__`
refusing a rank-zero value instead of reading a dimension it has not. Print and equality already
handled rank zero, and no operator takes an open rank today, so arithmetic has no rank-zero path.
The self-test checks rank 0 / one element / size 1 / prints "1.0" / equals a 1.0 and not a 2.0.

